{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"text\": \"为难时，先前那份柔软又浮上来，他舍不得马上把它压下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"柔软又浮上来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿意再爱惜片刻，把没答案的事先搁一边。\",\n      \"key\": \"爱惜片刻\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里暂时松下来，知道这点安静留不久，仍觉得欢喜，也舍不得它退去。\",\n      \"key\": \"安静留不久\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R40\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留为难时熟悉的柔软重新浮现、他舍不得压下的事实，不再把听感中的柔软具体化为想起某种生活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R41\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留先前真实的满足给他再次停留的理由，改为具体的暂时停留，不用反问替他总结道理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R42\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留短暂松动、欢喜和预感安静将退去的事实，说明这只是一次喘息，并非重新安顿下来。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fc74ff21-e246-4e08-b285-4269bf8fedf0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012057553420Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:21:53.850663+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continua